  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 589a77387c7c4ea488d9368fe6c3cd2f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sub Dialogue 2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - Now that you have your NORMALIZED embedding, we can move on to the next couple
    of steps of our ENCODER.
  - First,  this new embedding must be refed into a NEURAL NETWORK to consolidate
    the information of the POSITIONAL ENCODER and the ATTENTION mechanism. Don't
    forget to keep a duplication of your NORMALIZED embedding around for future RESIDUAL
    CONNECTIONS!
  - After embedding with the NEURAL NETWORK, you can add your RESIDUAL CONNECTION
    and NORMALIZE the resulting embedding once more. This is the final step of the
    ENCODER.
